[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0120","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0120.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17270","title":"Yachtcontrol 系统 未授权远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Yachtcontrol 是一款用于船舶监控与控制的 Web 应用系统。该漏洞存在于 Yachtcontrol 2019-10-06 及之前版本的 `/pages/systemcall.php` 页面中，由于未对用户输入进行身份验证和命令过滤，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 `command` 参数传递任意操作系统命令，直接在服务器上执行系统指令并获取返回结果。该漏洞影响通过荷兰 GPRS/4G 移动 IP 段公开的 Yachtcontrol Web 服务器，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需任何凭据即可利用此漏洞完全控制服务器。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17270"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-12-10T21:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:38Z","remediation":"立即更新 Yachtcontrol 软件到最新的安全补丁版本。Yachtcontrol 网站维护者应立即从 http://download.yachtcontrol.nl/klant/Software/ 下载并安装最新的安全更新。更新应涵盖 `/pages/systemcall.php` 中的命令执行漏洞。如果无法立即更新，建议在防火墙上禁用对 `/pages/systemcall.php?command` 参数的访问，并限制仅对可信IP地址开放该页面作为临时缓解措施。该漏洞影响所有 2019-10-06 及之前的 Yachtcontrol 版本，建议所有受影响用户尽快应用补丁。更多详细的修补丁信息可在 Yachtcontrol 官方网站 http://www.yachtcontrol.nl/en/ 获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155582/Yachtcontrol-2019-10-06-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47760","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17270.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17270.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17270.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-17270.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-17270-3974.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-17270-3969.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-17270-3972.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-17270-3971.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-17270-3973.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17270.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Yachtcontrol/CVE-2019-17270.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0120.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0073","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-14251","title":"TEMENOS T24 Channels 路径遍历漏洞","description":"TEMENOS T24 R15.01 版本的 WealthT24 模块中 GetImage Java Servlet 存在路径遍历漏洞。该漏洞源于登录页面的 downloadDocServer() JavaScript 函数在调用 GetImage 接口时，未对 docDownloadPath 和 uploadLocation 参数进行有效的路径过滤与校验。未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需登录即可直接向 /WealthT24/GetImage 接口发送特制请求，通过路径遍历技术读取服务器文件系统中的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 或 Windows 配置文件），甚至可利用 SMB 协议回传攻击者控制的服务器以窃取 NTLM 哈希值，导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-14251"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-12-09T17:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:18:02Z","remediation":"联系TEMENOS厂商获取安全补丁，将T24 Channels升级至R15.01以上修复版本。如无法立即升级，在Web应用防火墙或反向代理层面添加规则，拦截对/WealthT24/GetImage接口的请求中docDownloadPath和uploadLocation参数包含路径遍历序列（如../）的恶意流量，并对该接口实施严格的输入白名单验证，仅允许访问指定目录下的文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kmkz/exploit/blob/master/CVE-2019-14251-TEMENOS-T24.txt","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14251.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-14251.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-14251.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-14251.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14251-3837.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-14251-3838.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2019-14251.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0b2099d0f1ceb94625ab1ba6dca5a48307538ab8/cves/2019/14xxx/CVE-2019-14251.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/temenos/t24/CVE-2019-14251.yaml","https://github.com/kmkz/Exploits/blob/9fd8f06e1b3407ee28abdcfb8e69a8d53fe866af/2019/CVE-2019-14251-TEMENOS-T24.txt","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-14251.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1308","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-5544","title":"VMware ESXi OpenSLP 堆缓冲区覆写漏洞","description":"VMware ESXi 及 Horizon DaaS 设备中使用的 OpenSLP 服务存在堆缓冲区覆写漏洞（CWE-787），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送精心构造的 SLP（服务位置协议）数据包触发堆内存破坏，进而在目标系统上实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 VMware ESXi 6.5/6.7 及 Horizon DaaS 相关版本，CVSS v3.1 评分 9.8（严重），攻击向量为网络（AV:N）、攻击复杂度低（AC:L）、无需权限（PR:N）且无需用户交互（UI:N），可直接导致系统完全沦陷。VMware 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞，建议受影响用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-5544"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-06T16:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:37:52Z","remediation":"建议立即将 VMware ESXi 升级至 6.7 Update 2 或 6.5 Update 3 及其更高版本。若无法立即更新，可通过执行命令 `vim-cmd hostsvc/slp-set-enabled 0` 禁用 SLP 服务，或在防火墙中拦截 TCP/UDP 427 端口以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/12/10/2","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2019/12/11/2","http://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2019-0022.html","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:4240","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2020:0199","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/DA3LYAJ2NRKMOZLZOQNDJ5TNQRFMWGHF/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/ZPXXJZLPLAQULBCJVI5NNWZ3PGWXGXWG/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202005-12","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-5544","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/network/cves/2019/CVE-2019-5544.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-5544.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-5544.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bc943eb819a406135c2391ed30d595e2ea60281b/2019/5xxx/CVE-2019-5544.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2020/CVE-2020-3992.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/ed3533775a9ade21f1577e57c130e65e8f80898c/2019/CVE-2019-5544.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-5544.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2021/CVE-2021-21974.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-5544.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-5544/README.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/afc0df6edf4ea320b0cfac74a53aafd9b4a9697f/vex/cve/2019/CVE-2019-5544.json","https://github.com/dgh05t/VMware_ESXI_OpenSLP_PoCs","https://github.com/HynekPetrak/CVE-2019-5544_CVE-2020-3992"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1508","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7195","title":"QNAP Photo Station 路径遍历漏洞","description":"QNAP NAS 设备上运行的 Photo Station 存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含目录遍历序列（如 \"../\"）的特殊请求参数，绕过应用程序的文件路径限制，从而访问或修改设备上的任意系统文件。该漏洞影响搭载 QTS 4.2.6、4.3.0–4.3.3、4.3.4–4.4.0 及 4.4.1 系统且 Photo Station 版本低于 5.2.11、5.4.9、5.7.10 或 6.0.3 的 QNAP 网络存储设备。攻击者无需登录凭据即可在无需用户交互的情况下远程利用此漏洞，成功利用后可读取敏感配置文件、窃取凭证或进一步植入恶意程序导致远程代码执行。该漏洞已被美国 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），且确认在勒索软件攻击活动中被实际利用，CVSS v3.1 评分为 9.8（严重等级）。建议用户立即将 Photo Station 升级至 QNAP 官方发布的最新版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7195"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-05T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:14Z","remediation":"登录 QTS 管理界面，进入控制面板 > 系统 > 固件更新，将 QTS 更新至 4.4.1 build 20190918 或更高版本。随后打开 App Center，搜索 Photo Station 并更新至对应修复版本：QTS 4.4.1 用户更新至 Photo Station 6.0.3，QTS 4.3.4–4.4.0 更新至 5.7.10，QTS 4.3.0–4.3.3 更新至 5.4.9，QTS 4.2.6 更新至 5.2.11。如暂无法更新，应临时关闭 Photo Station 服务以降低路径遍历攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157857/QNAP-QTS-And-Photo-Station-6.0.3-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://www.qnap.com/zh-tw/security-advisory/nas-201911-25","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7195","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7195.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7195.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7195.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7195.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/qnap/photo_station/CVE-2019-7195.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-7195.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-7195.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-7195.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-7195.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2019/CVE-2019-7195.yaml","https://github.com/halilkirazkaya/cve-poc-garage/blob/3ab499ea42cde33b2ad01310272e558227f2c5e6/2019/CVE-2019-7195.md","https://github.com/th3gundy/CVE-2019-7192_QNAP_Exploit","https://github.com/cycraft-corp/cve-2019-7192-check"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1506","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7194","title":"QNAP Photo Station 路径遍历漏洞","description":"QNAP Photo Station 存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），远程攻击者可在无需认证的情况下，通过向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用对文件名或路径参数的外部控制，实现目录穿越，从而读取或修改系统任意文件。该漏洞影响 QNAP NAS 设备上的 Photo Station 应用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。QNAP 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级 Photo Station 至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7194"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-05T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:14Z","remediation":"立即将 QTS 系统更新至 QTS 4.4.1 build 20190918 及以上版本（或 QTS 4.3.6 build 20190919 及以上版本），并将 Photo Station 更新至对应版本：QTS 4.4.1 用户升级至 Photo Station 6.0.3 及以上、QTS 4.3.4~4.4.0 用户升级至 5.7.10 及以上、QTS 4.3.0~4.3.3 用户升级至 5.4.9 及以上、QTS 4.2.6 用户升级至 5.2.11 及以上。更新方法：以管理员身份登录 QTS，进入「控制台」→「系统」→「固件更新」执行 Live Update，或在 App Center 中搜索 Photo Station 点击更新。如无法立即更新，建议在防火墙上限制对 NAS 管理端口（8080/443）和 Photo Station 服务的公网访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157857/QNAP-QTS-And-Photo-Station-6.0.3-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://www.qnap.com/zh-tw/security-advisory/nas-201911-25","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7194","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7194.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7194.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7194.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7194.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7194.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/qnap/photo_station/CVE-2019-7194.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-7194.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-7194.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-7194.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2019/CVE-2019-7194.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-7194.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1500","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7193","title":"QNAP QTS 输入验证错误漏洞","description":"QNAP QTS 操作系统存在输入验证错误漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的网络请求触发该漏洞，导致任意代码注入执行。该漏洞影响多款 QNAP NAS 设备上的 QTS 操作系统，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，攻击无需用户交互及特殊权限。QNAP 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7193"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-05T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:14Z","remediation":"立即将 QTS 升级至 4.4.1 build 20190918 及以上版本（或 4.3.6 build 20190919 及以上版本），并将 Photo Station 升级至对应版本（QTS 4.4.1 需 Photo Station 6.0.3+，QTS 4.3.4-4.4.0 需 5.7.10+，QTS 4.3.0-4.3.3 需 5.4.9+，QTS 4.2.6 需 5.2.11+）。升级路径：以管理员身份登录 QTS → 控制面板 → 系统 → 固件更新 → 检查更新；Photo Station 通过 App Center 搜索并点击更新。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙上限制对 NAS 管理端口（默认 8080/443）的互联网访问，仅允许可信内网 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157857/QNAP-QTS-And-Photo-Station-6.0.3-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://www.qnap.com/zh-tw/security-advisory/nas-201911-25","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7193","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7193.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7193.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7193.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-7193.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-7193.md","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2019/CVE-2019-7193.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-7193.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-7193.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/df225994fea2bf22c3b73491021c40bfd2f964e1/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-7193.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-7193.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1500.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1500.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1409","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-7192","title":"QNAP Photo Station 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"QNAP Photo Station 的 video.php 文件存在不当访问控制漏洞，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过特制 HTTP 请求直接访问本应受限的后端接口，无需任何权限即可在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多版本 QNAP NAS 设备上的 Photo Station，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者只需知道目标设备的网络地址即可远程触发，无需用户交互。QNAP 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户升级 Photo Station 至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-7192"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-12-05T17:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:40:14Z","remediation":"根据 QNAP 官方安全公告 NAS-201911-25，请按以下版本对应升级 Photo Station：QTS 4.4.1 升级至 6.0.3 及以上、QTS 4.3.4-4.4.0 升级至 5.7.10 及以上、QTS 4.3.0-4.3.3 升级至 5.4.9 及以上、QTS 4.2.6 升级至 5.2.11 及以上。操作路径：QTS Web 管理界面 → App Center → 已安装应用 → Photo Station → 检查更新。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或反向代理层面限制对 /photo/ 路径的匿名访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157857/QNAP-QTS-And-Photo-Station-6.0.3-Remote-Command-Execution.html","https://www.qnap.com/zh-tw/security-advisory/nas-201911-25","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-7192","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-7192.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7192.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-7192.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-7192-4192.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/QNAP/CVE-2019-7192.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/medbsq/templates/CVE-2019-7192.yaml","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/qnap/poc_qnap-cve-2019-7192_2019.py","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/256acfffdec561159f01d27b17d0320e6463101a/2019/7xxx/CVE-2019-7192.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/qnap-cve-2019-7192.yml","https://github.com/awake1t/linglong/blob/bedbe49597412abab1c1635e133957d782e65325/pkg/pocs/qnap-cve-2019-7192.yml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-7194.md","https://github.com/th3gundy/CVE-2019-7192_QNAP_Exploit","https://github.com/cycraft-corp/cve-2019-7192-check"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0668","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0668.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15271","title":"Cisco Small Business RV系列路由器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Cisco Small Business RV 系列路由器基于 Web 的管理接口存在命令注入漏洞，由于对 HTTP 请求负载缺乏充分的输入验证，已通过身份认证的远程攻击者可利用有效的凭据或活动会话令牌，向目标设备的管理接口发送特制的 HTTP 请求，从而以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响多款 RV 系列路由器，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15271"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-26T03:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:19:59Z","remediation":"立即将 Cisco Small Business RV 系列路由器（RV016/RV042/RV042G/RV082）固件升级至 4.2.3.10 或更高版本。登录设备 Web 管理界面，进入 Administration > Firmware Upgrade，上传官方固件文件并重启。如无法立即升级，可在管理界面中限制仅允许受信任的内网 IP 访问 Web 管理端口（默认 443/80），并禁用 WAN 侧远程管理功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20191106-sbrv-cmd-x","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-15271","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-15271.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15271.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2019/15xxx/CVE-2019-15271.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-15271.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-15271.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-15271.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/3a751de84316f1f1910c7d0a918a0e2c4180a6d3/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-15271.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-15271.json","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/13889512387aab8222dfb3d51d4f65251575a372/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2019-15271","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-15271.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0668.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1400","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-5825","title":"Google Chrome JavaScript 越界写入漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 73.0.3683.86 之前版本的 JavaScript 引擎中存在越界写入漏洞，具体位于 Array.map 方法实现中。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTML 页面，诱使受害者访问，从而触发堆内存损坏，导致浏览器崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Chrome 72 及 73 版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Google 已在 73.0.3683.86 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-5825"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-25T20:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:38:16Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 73.0.3683.86 或更高版本。可通过 Chrome 设置 > 关于 Chrome > 自动检查更新完成升级。如无法立即更新，建议启用 Chrome 安全浏览功能并避免访问不可信网页，同时关注 Chrome 自动更新推送及时安装。该漏洞已有公开 Metasploit 利用模块，应优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156641/Google-Chrome-72-73-Array.map-Corruption.html","https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2019/04/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_30.html","https://crbug.com/941743","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-5825","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48183","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-5825.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-5825.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/73e213348ddf142cab7e77d05861fa314ba8e1d0/cves/2019/5xxx/CVE-2019-5825.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2019/5xxx/CVE-2019-5825.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-5825.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-5825.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-5825.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-5825.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-5825/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-5825.md","https://github.com/timwr/CVE-2019-5825"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1400.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1400.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0520","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0520.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-13720","title":"Google Chrome WebAudio 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 78.0.3904.87 之前版本的 WebAudio 组件中存在释放后使用（Use-after-free）漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制的 HTML 页面，诱使用户访问后触发堆内存破坏，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows/Mac/Linux 全平台 Chrome 浏览器，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Google 已在 Chrome 78.0.3904.87 版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户及时更新。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-13720"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-25T15:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:17:17Z","remediation":"立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 78.0.3904.87 或更高版本，可通过 Chrome 菜单「帮助」→「关于 Google Chrome」自动检查更新。使用 Electron 框架的应用需升级至 electron@6.1.4 或 electron@7.0.1 及以上版本。如无法立即更新，可禁用 WebAudio 功能（通过组策略或企业策略配置 DisableWebAudio 为 true）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2019-12/msg00022.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/167066/Google-Chrome-78.0.3904.70-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2019/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_31.html","https://crbug.com/1019226","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202004-04","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-13720","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/50917","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-13720.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-13720.json","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-13720.md","https://github.com/electron/website/blob/e907558b88646e1fe27debdc269d0c457d186e89/blog/cve-2019-13720.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/52ab10bd804e22d7a1e3ce8d118700d9c56bd957/2019/CVE-2019-13720.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-13720.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-13720.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-13720.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-13720.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-13720/README.md","https://github.com/forrest-orr/WizardOpium","https://github.com/cve-2019-13720/cve-2019-13720"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0520.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0520.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0520.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1008","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-19006","title":"Sangoma FreePBX 访问控制不当漏洞","description":"Sangoma FreePBX 存在不正确的访问控制漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞绕过权限检查，直接访问系统管理接口或执行敏感操作，导致机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损。该漏洞影响 FreePBX 13.0.197.13 及更早版本、14.0.13.11 及更早版本、15.0.16.26 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需用户交互，利用复杂度低，建议用户立即升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-19006"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-21T18:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T15:45:04Z","remediation":"立即将 FreePBX 升级至 13.0.197.14 及以上、14.0.13.12 及以上或 15.0.16.27 及以上版本，该漏洞已在 GitHub 提交 4e4675d 中修复（重排认证流程顺序并对 password 参数做强制类型转换）。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（Nginx/Apache）添加规则拦截 password[] 数组参数传递，并限制 FreePBX 管理后台仅允许可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.freepbx.org/t/freepbx-security-vulnerability-sec-2019-001/62772","https://pastebin.com/2CdsQMKW","https://wiki.freepbx.org/display/FOP/2019-11-20+Remote+Admin+Authentication+Bypass","https://www.freepbx.org/category/blog/","https://research.checkpoint.com/2020/inj3ctor3-operation-leveraging-asterisk-servers-for-monetization/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-19006","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-19006.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2019/CVE-2019-19006.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2019/19xxx/CVE-2019-19006.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2019/19xxx/CVE-2019-19006.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-19006.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-19006.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-19006.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-19006.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-19006.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/003e8cad66924d61c3369093ab10818154ac5271/CVEs/2019/CVE-2019-19006.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1008.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1408","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-6693","title":"Fortinet FortiOS 配置备份文件硬编码加密密钥信息泄露漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 配置备份文件中使用了硬编码加密密钥对敏感数据进行加密，具有备份文件访问权限的攻击者可利用该硬编码密钥解密备份文件中的敏感信息。受影响的数据包括用户密码（管理员密码除外）、私钥口令以及高可用性密码。该漏洞源于 CWE-798 硬编码凭证使用缺陷，攻击者无需用户交互即可通过本地或远程获取备份文件的方式实施解密攻击，导致敏感信息泄露。CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-6693"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-21T16:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:39:31Z","remediation":"` tags. I need to write a clean, proper remediation in Chinese based on the Fortinet advisory information.\n\nFrom the presearch data:\n- FortiOS versions affected: 5.6.9 and below, 6.0.5 and below, 6.2.0\n- The fix is to upgrade to 5.6.11+, 6.0.7+, or 6.2.1+\n- Also need to enable `private-data-encryption` in config\n- CISA KEV listed, so it's actively exploited\n\nLet me write a clean remediation.<value>建议立即升级 FortiOS 至 5.6.11、6.0.7 或 6.2.1 及以上版本，然后执行 `config system global` → `set private-data-encryption enable` → `end` 启用用户自定义加密密钥。如无法立即升级，备份配置文件时必须设置密码保护，避免在非安全渠道公开配置文件内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-19-007","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-6693","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-6693.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-6693.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2019/6xxx/CVE-2019-6693.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2019/6xxx/CVE-2019-6693.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/96acb02a8d6942d7cdf496f8d887cd0035972f4b/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-6693.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/ed3533775a9ade21f1577e57c130e65e8f80898c/2019/CVE-2019-6693.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/96acb02a8d6942d7cdf496f8d887cd0035972f4b/data/2019/CVE-2019-6693-gquere_CVE-2019-6693.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/96acb02a8d6942d7cdf496f8d887cd0035972f4b/data/2019/CVE-2019-6693-Real4XoR_cve-2019-6693.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-6693.md","https://github.com/tijldeneut/Security/blob/24b4cbd974d39d7c4ff1ae31bed41b3522106994/CVE-2019-6693.py","https://github.com/saladandonionrings/cve-2019-6693","https://github.com/synacktiv/CVE-2020-9289","https://github.com/gquere/CVE-2019-6693","https://github.com/Real4XoR/CVE-2019-6693"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0606","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1429","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 脚本引擎内存损坏漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 的脚本引擎在处理内存中对象时存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的网站诱导用户访问，触发 JScript 引擎在 toJSON 回调过程中对已释放内存的引用，从而在当前用户权限下执行任意代码。攻击成功可完全控制受影响的系统，安装程序、查看/更改/删除数据或创建新账户。该漏洞需要用户交互（点击链接），影响 Internet Explorer 9/10/11 等版本，Microsoft 已在 2019 年 11 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1429"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-12T19:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:35Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 11 月安全更新（对应 Windows 各版本的累积更新 KB 编号不同，如 Windows 10 为 KB4525232），或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议优先修复。如无法立即打补丁，可禁用 Internet Explorer 脚本引擎或通过组策略限制 IE 使用范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155433/Microsoft-Internet-Explorer-Use-After-Free.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1429","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1429","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47707","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1429.md","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/CVE-2019-1429 漏洞分析.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1429.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1429.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-14292.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-14298.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-14291.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-14293.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-14297.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-14290.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0606.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0600","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0600.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1405","title":"Microsoft Windows UPnP 服务特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows UPnP 服务在创建 COM 对象时未正确验证调用者权限，存在权限提升漏洞。本地低权限攻击者可通过向 UPnP 服务发送特制的 COM 对象创建请求，利用该漏洞以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Windows 10 1803 至 1903 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 11 月安全更新中修复此漏洞，公开的 PoC 名称为 \"COMahawk\"。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1405"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-12T19:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:32Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 11 月安全更新：Windows 10 v1903 安装 KB4525237，v1809/Server 2019 安装 KB4525235，v1803 安装 KB4525237，v1709 安装 KB4525241，v1607/Server 2016 安装 KB4525236，Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 安装 KB4525242，Windows 7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4525235，Server 2012 安装 KB4525243，Server 2008 SP2 安装 KB4525234。如无法立即打补丁，可禁用 UPnP 服务（sc stop UPnPHost & sc config UPnPHost start=disabled）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155723/M