STEM 权限执行命令。该漏洞影响 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 及 Windows 7/8.1/10 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），Microsoft 已在 2019 年 11 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1388"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-11-12T19:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:30Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2019 年 11 月安全更新。各版本对应补丁：Windows 7 SP1 (KB4525235)、Windows 8.1 (KB4525243)、Windows 10 v1809 (KB4525232)、Windows Server 2019 (KB4525232)。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。无临时缓解措施，必须打补丁修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1388","https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-19-975/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1388","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1388.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-1388/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/CVE-2019-1388/README_EN.md","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2019-1388.cs","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1388.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1388.json","https://github.com/izj007/wechat/blob/3de7f7edc20777e0fb256eb204866383d42d5f2f/articles/[snowming]-2021-8-15-CVE-2019-1388：通过 UAC 进行 Windows 提权.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1388.md","https://github.com/syselement/tcm-sec-notes/blob/80d35f1b8a0848f3db433d6755c799ac51a884a7/wpe/2-win-privesc-paths/10-wpe-cve-2019-1388.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781c